3E%3Cli%3EIt%20comes%20as%20European%20automakers%20face%20stiff%20competition%20from%20low-cost%20Chinese%20automakers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHigh%20energy%20prices%2C%20complex%20vehicle%20portfolios%2C%20and%20US%20auto%20tariffs%20aren't%20helping%2C%20either.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EVolkswagen%20plans%20to%20cut%20roughly%2050%2C000%20more%20jobs%20worldwide.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Thursday%2C%20the%20company's%20supervisory%20board%20approved%20its%20%26quot%3BFuture%20Plan%202030%2C%26quot%3B%20a%2012-part%20restructuring%20effort%20that%20Volkswagen%20calls%20the%20%26quot%3Bmost%20extensive%20transformation%20program%26quot%3B%20in%20its%20history.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVolkswagen%20said%20a%20%26quot%3Bfundamental%20adjustment%26quot%3B%20of%20its%20global%20workforce%20%E2%80%94%20including%20management%20roles%20%E2%80%94%20will%20be%20necessary%20beyond%20its%20existing%20cost-cutting%20programs.%20It%20did%20not%20say%20where%20the%20positions%20would%20be%20eliminated%2C%20when%20the%20reductions%20would%20happen%2C%20or%20whether%20they%20would%20come%20through%20layoffs%2C%20buyouts%2C%20or%20attrition.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20job%20cuts%20are%20one%20piece%20of%20a%20much%20broader%20reset.%20Volkswagen%20plans%20to%20halve%20its%20model%20portfolio%20by%202035%20and%20reduce%20the%20complexity%20of%20its%20vehicle%20offerings%20by%20about%2075%25.%20It%20also%20aims%20to%20sell%20about%209%20million%20vehicles%20annually%20and%20reach%20a%209%25%20operating%20margin%20by%202030.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20will%20mean%20fewer%20models%20and%20variants%2C%20higher%20volumes%20for%20the%20cars%20it%20keeps%2C%20and%20lower%20costs%20across%20its%20sprawling%20group%20of%20brands%2C%20which%20includes%20Volkswagen%2C%20Audi%2C%20Porsche%2C%20%C5%A0koda%2C%20Seat%2C%20Cupra%2C%20Bentley%2C%20and%20Lamborghini.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20has%20been%20facing%20steep%20competition%20from%20lower-cost%20Chinese%20automakers%2C%20especially%20on%20its%20home%20turf%20in%20Europe.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvw-ends-production-ev-id-4-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eexpensive%20transition%20to%20%3C%2Fa%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvw-ends-production-ev-id-4-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eelectric%20vehicle%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0development%2C%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-tariffs-automakers-ford-vw-stellantis-respond-layoffs-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EUS%20automotive%20tariffs%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20high%20energy%20prices%20are%20not%20helping%20either.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20part%20of%20a%20larger%20trend%20in%20the%20auto%20industry%3A%20Car%20companies%20have%20gone%20through%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fautomakers-decluttering-era-evs-discontinued-cars-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20decluttering%20era%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20they%20try%20to%20reduce%20costs%20as%20they%20face%20the%20compounding%20headwinds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVolkswagen%20is%20one%20of%20the%20most%20dramatic%20examples.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Thursday%2C%20the%20automaker%20said%20its%20European%20factories%20have%20capacity%20for%20more%20than%20500%2C000%20vehicles%20beyond%20current%20demand.%20That%20leaves%20the%20future%20production%20plans%20for%20four%20German%20factories%20%E2%80%94%20Emden%2C%20Zwickau%2C%20Hanover%2C%20and%20Neckarsulm%20%E2%80%94%20uncertain%20from%202031%20through%202034.%20Volkswagen%20said%20it%20is%20considering%20alternative%20uses%20for%20the%20plants.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20new%20workforce%20reduction%20comes%20on%20top%20of%20existing%20programs.%20In%202024%2C%20Volkswagen%20AG%20agreed%20with%20labor%20representatives%20to%20cut%20more%20than%2035%2C000%20jobs%20at%20its%20German%20sites%20by%202030.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVolkswagen%20didn't%20immediately%20respond%20to%20Business%20Insider's%20questions%20about%20how%20its%20new%20global%20target%20overlaps%20with%20those%20earlier%20planned%20reductions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvw-job-cuts-overhaul-ev-chinese-cars-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788472330000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99e0ca755b3072e51cc19d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvw-job-cuts-overhaul-ev-chinese-cars-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Volkswagen%2C%20the%20world's%20second-largest%20automaker%2C%20is%20trying%20to%20get%20more%20nimble.%20It's%20planning%20huge%20job%20cuts%20as%20Chinese%20automakers%20step%20up%20competition.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22bshimkus%40insider.com%20(Ben%20Shimkus)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A97%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Oura%20takes%20step%20toward%20IPO%20with%20S-1%20filing%2C%20revealing%20%241.4%20billion%20in%20revenue%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Glossy%20black%20smart%20ring%20rests%20on%20an%20open%20charging%20case%20on%20a%20wooden%20surface.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99e634799bd8525cffd80c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222668%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20company%20behind%20the%20Oura%20Ring%20filed%20its%20S-1%2C%20a%20required%20step%20on%20the%20road%20to%20an%20IPO.%3Cp%3EAngel%20Garcia%2FBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOura%20filed%20its%20S-1%20paperwork%20on%20Thursday%2C%20taking%20a%20key%20step%20toward%20an%20initial%20public%20offering.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOura%20reported%20%241.4%20billion%20in%20revenue%20and%20%2459%20million%20in%20net%20income%20for%20the%20year%20ending%20in%20June.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOura%20said%20it%20has%205%20million%20paid%20members%20and%20plans%20to%20list%20on%20Nasdaq%20under%20the%20ticker%20OURA.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Foura-ring-4-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOura%20just%3C%2Fa%3E%20got%20one%20step%20closer%20to%20becoming%20a%20public%20company.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Foura-ring-jacket-luxury-diamond-gold-trend-upgrade-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esmart-ring%20maker%3C%2Fa%3E%20filed%20its%20S-1%20paperwork%20on%20Thursday%2C%20a%20required%20step%20on%20the%20road%20to%20an%20initial%20public%20offering.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20filing%20said%20Oura%20pulled%20in%20%241.4%20billion%20in%20revenue%20and%20%2459%20million%20in%20net%20income%20in%20the%20one-year%20period%20that%20ended%20in%20June.%20The%20company%20said%20revenue%20had%20grown%2074%25%20year-over-year%2C%20comparing%20the%20first%20three%20quarters%20of%20fiscal%20year%202026%20to%20the%20same%20period%20in%202025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOura%20also%20said%20in%20the%20filing%20that%20it%20has%20%26quot%3Ba%20history%20of%20operating%20losses%26quot%3B%20and%20has%20%26quot%3Bonly%20recently%20achieved%20profitability%2C%26quot%3B%20adding%20%26quot%3Bthere%20can%20be%20no%20assurance%20that%20we%20will%20maintain%20profitability%20in%20any%20future%20period.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20filing%20showed%20Oura%20incurred%20losses%20of%20%24924%20million%20on%20revenue%20of%20%241.21%20billion%20for%20the%20nine-month%20period%20ended%20in%20June.%20For%20the%20same%20period%20a%20year%20prior%2C%20the%20company's%20losses%20were%20%24182.8%20million%20on%20revenues%20of%20%24697.6%20million.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fday-in-the-life-ceo-oura-ring-tom-hale-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOura%20Ring%20maker%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20plans%20to%20list%20on%20the%20Nasdaq%20under%20the%20ticker%20OURA%2C%20had%205%20million%20paid%20members%20as%20of%20June%2C%20the%20filing%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20filing%20lists%20several%20risk%20factors%20facing%20the%20company%2C%20as%20is%20required%20in%20S-1s%20by%20the%20Securities%20and%20Exchange%20Commission.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20experienced%20rapid%20growth%20in%20recent%20years%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20risk%20factors%20section%20says.%20%26quot%3BThis%20rapid%20growth%20may%20not%20be%20sustainable%20or%20indicative%20of%20future%20performance%2C%20and%20we%20expect%20our%20growth%20rate%20to%20slow%20over%20time.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20said%20current%20trade%20tensions%20and%20tariffs%20could%20increase%20the%20cost%20of%20some%20of%20its%20products%2C%20while%20broader%20economic%20pressure%20and%20changes%20in%20consumer%20spending%20levels%20could%20impact%20its%20business.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20filing%20also%20said%20much%20of%20Oura's%20revenue%20comes%20from%20a%20%26quot%3Blimited%20number%20of%20retail%20partners.%26quot%3B%20The%20company%20said%20that%20for%20the%20nine%20months%20ended%20in%20June%2C%20its%20two%20largest%20customers%20accounted%20for%2012%25%20and%2010%25%20of%20its%20total%20revenue%2C%20respectively.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOura%20said%20its%20business%20relies%20on%20outside%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-cybersecurity-incidents-openai-astra-anthropic-kimi-meta-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAI%20models%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20including%20OpenAI%2C%20Anthropic%2C%20and%20Google%2C%20and%20on%20third-party%20data%20centers%2C%20adding%20that%20disruptions%20to%20the%20data%20centers%20could%20impact%20the%20company.%20It%20also%20said%20there%20were%20%26quot%3Blegal%2C%20regulatory%2C%20ethical%2C%20security%2C%20or%20reputational%20risks%26quot%3B%20associated%20with%20AI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20story%20is%20breaking.%20Check%20back%20for%20updates.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.busi