OpenAI%20president%20Greg%20Brockman%20said%20he%20thinks%20Astra%2C%20the%20lab's%20new%20model%2C%20likely%20represents%20AGI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAGI%2C%20or%20artificial%20general%20intelligence%2C%20generally%20refers%20to%20AI%20that%20matches%20or%20outperforms%20humans.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Astra%20model%20marks%20a%20breakthrough%20in%20delegating%20work%2C%20according%20to%20OpenAI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20says%20that%20its%20new%20model%20has%20reached%20the%20AI%20industry's%20most%20sought-after%20milestone.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWelcome%20to%20the%20AGI%20era%2C%26quot%3B%20Greg%20Brockman%2C%20the%20company's%20president%2C%20said%20at%20the%20end%20of%20a%20press%20call%20announcing%20the%20arrival%20of%20OpenAI's%20Astra%20model%20on%20Thursday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAGI%20stands%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsam-altman-openai-the-singularity-agi-prediction-anthropic-nvidia-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eartificial%20general%20intelligence%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20fuzzy%20concept%20that%20nonetheless%20has%20become%20a%20core%20goal%20for%20AI%20development.%20OpenAI%20defines%20it%20as%20%26quot%3Bhighly%20autonomous%20systems%20that%20outperform%20humans%20at%20most%20economically%20valuable%20work.%26quot%3B%20The%20company%20pitched%20Astra%20as%20a%20major%20research%20breakthrough%20and%20a%20shift%20in%20what's%20possible%20to%20delegate%20to%20AI.%20It's%20rolling%20out%20to%20customers%20this%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBrockman%20has%20described%20reaching%20AGI%20as%20a%20gradual%20process.%20On%20the%20Thursday%20call%2C%20he%20said%20that%20in%20the%20future%2C%20he%20thinks%20people%20will%20look%20back%20and%20think%20AGI%20was%20created%20%26quot%3Babout%20this%20time%2C%20and%20I%20think%20it%20might%20be%20about%20this%20model.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFor%20me%20personally%2C%20I%20do%20think%20we're%20there%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGPT-6%20Astra%20comes%20about%20a%20year%20after%20OpenAI%20launched%20its%20GPT-5%20model%20family%20and%20about%20two%20months%20after%20its%20most%20recent%20upgrades%2C%20dubbed%20GPT-5.6.%20The%20company%20called%20Astra%20%26quot%3Bthe%20world's%20most%20intelligent%20and%20aligned%20model%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20a%20%26quot%3Bstep%20change%20in%20professional%20work.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20model%20will%20also%20improve%20ChatGPT's%20%26quot%3Bcomputer%20use%26quot%3B%20abilities%2C%20the%20company%20said.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-chatgpt-automates-tasks-computer-use-data-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOpenAI%20employees%20told%20Business%20Insider%20%3C%2Fa%3Elast%20month%20that%20those%20tools%20%E2%80%94%20which%20run%20tasks%20autonomously%20on%20a%20user's%20desktop%20computer%20or%20internet%20browser%20%E2%80%94%20have%20reached%20an%20inflection%20point.%20The%20blog%20post%20said%20Astra%20can%20fill%20out%20forms%2C%20format%20documents%2C%20schedule%20appointments%2C%20and%20operate%20software.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20successful%20%26quot%3Bcomputer%20use%26quot%3B%20AI%20agents%20have%20been%20a%20long-standing%20goal%20of%20OpenAI%20and%20other%20tech%20giants%2C%20the%20technology%20is%20tricky%20because%20there's%20such%20a%20wide%20variety%20in%20people's%20desktop%20work%2C%20and%20so%20far%2C%20the%20tools%20have%20been%20fairly%20slow.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAnything%20you%20can%20do%20on%20a%20computer%2C%20Astra%20can%20do%20for%20you.%20Fast%2C%26quot%3B%20OpenAI%20wrote%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20previously%20said%20it%20delayed%20Astra's%20release%20until%20September%20after%20identifying%20improvements%20in%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-collective-action-cyber-defense-anthropic-hugging-face-hack-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecybersecurity%20capabilities%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20wrote%20earlier%20this%20week%20that%20it%20needed%20to%20ensure%20Astra's%20safeguards%20block%20its%20use%20by%20bad%20actors%20for%20hacking%20and%20that%20the%20model%20itself%20is%20aligned%20to%20do%20what's%20asked%20of%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELike%20Brockman%2C%20other%20tech%20leaders%20have%20held%20up%20AGI%20as%20a%20goal.%20Google%20DeepMind%20cofounder%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdeepmind-ceo-demis-hassabis-predicts-ai-singularity-google-io-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDemis%20Hassabis%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20at%20the%20company's%20May%20conference%20that%20he%20expected%20AGI%20to%20arrive%20as%20soon%20as%202030%2C%20adding%20that%20humanity%20is%20standing%20%26quot%3Bon%20the%20foothills%20of%20the%20singularity.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%2C%20for%20his%20part%2C%20told%20the%20Sources%20podcast%20in%20a%20recent%20appearance%20that%20AGI%20is%2C%20at%20best%2C%20%26quot%3Ba%20very%20poorly%20defined%20term.%20I%20was%20going%20to%20say%20it's%20like%20an%20irrelevant%20marketing%20term.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Ascouncil%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3Escouncil%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%2C%20or%20over%20text%2C%20Signal%2C%20Telegram%2C%20or%20WhatsApp%20at%20415-757-8198.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-guide-to-securely-sharing-whistleblower-information-about-powerful-institutions-2021-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3Ehere's%20our%20guide%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20to%20sharing%20information%20securely.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fastra-model-launch-agi-milestone-openai-greg-brockm