20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%20noreferrer%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbobby-jain-global-first-year-charts-numbers-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewere%20dragged%20down%3C%2Fa%3E%20by%20the%20high%20costs%20of%20starting%20a%20new%20firm%20with%20seven%20different%20investing%20businesses%2C%20and%20by%20the%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%20noreferrer%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhedge-funds-to-watch-in-2026-millennium-point72-coatue-avantyr-2025-12%23jain-global-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edelayed%20deployment%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20the%20firm's%20initial%20%245.3%20billion%20in%20capital%2C%20in%20part%20due%20to%20lengthy%20non-compete%20periods%20that%20investment%20talent%20had%20to%20wait%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEventually%2C%20Jain%20%E2%80%94%20the%20former%20co-chief%20investment%20officer%20of%20Millennium%20%E2%80%94%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%20noreferrer%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjain-global-returns-money-investors-exclusive-deal-millennium-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edecided%20to%20return%20outside%20capital%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20exclusively%20manage%20money%20for%20Izzy%20Englander's%20firm.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20firm%20once%20counted%20some%20of%20the%20world's%20biggest%20allocators%20as%20backers%2C%20including%20Singaporean%20sovereign%20wealth%20fund%20GIC%20and%20the%20Abu%20Dhabi%20Investment%20Authority.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20despite%20the%20change%20in%20trajectory%2C%20there's%20optimism%20within%20the%20New%20York-based%20firm%2C%20which%20will%20operate%20independently%20and%20has%20more%20than%20400%20staffers%20across%20its%20seven%20offices.%20The%20manager%20is%20hiring%20across%20its%20different%20units%20and%20was%20able%20to%20retain%20Adam%20Wangner%2C%20the%20firm's%20head%20of%20linear%20equities%20risk%2C%20after%20the%20deal%20was%20announced%2C%20Business%20Insider%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A