.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMark%20Zuckerberg%20shared%20his%20reservations%20about%20it%20with%20President%20Donald%20Trump.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThis%20story%20was%20reported%20by%20Business%20Insider%20and%20POLITICO%2C%20part%20of%20the%20Axel%20Springer%20Global%20Reporters%20Network.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmark-zuckerberg-meta-ai-pr-campaign-cash-payments-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMeta%20CEO%20Mark%20Zuckerberg%3C%2Fa%3E%20expressed%20concerns%20about%20plans%20for%20a%20national%20AI%20regulator%20in%20a%20previously%20unreported%20phone%20call%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-google-and-anthropic-white-house-meeting-biggest-questions-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPresident%20Donald%20Trump%3C%2Fa%3E%20last%20month%2C%20marking%20the%20involvement%20of%20one%20of%20the%20world's%20top%20tech%20executives%20in%20a%20fraught%20White%20House%20policy%20debate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20proposal%2C%20championed%20by%20the%20Nobel%20Prize-winning%20Google%20DeepMind%20scientist%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-deepmind-ceo-demis-hassabis-agi-safety-standards-body-gemini-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDemis%20Hassabis%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20favored%20by%20some%20top%20White%20House%20officials%2C%20would%20create%20an%20independent%20organization%20modeled%20on%20the%20Financial%20Industry%20Regulatory%20Authority%2C%20or%20FINRA%2C%20the%20organization%20that%20oversees%20the%20securities%20industry%20under%20the%20supervision%20of%20the%20Securities%20and%20Exchange%20Commission.%20White%20House%20officials%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bloomberg.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2F2026-07-17%2Fus-considers-creating-finra-like-watchdog-to-vet-top-ai-models%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eenvision%20the%20group%20%3C%2Fa%3Ereviewing%20advanced%20models%20and%20testing%20them%20for%20potential%20risks%20before%20they%20are%20deployed%20more%20broadly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20Trump%20spoke%20with%20Zuckerberg%20directly%20the%20week%20of%20August%2017%2C%20Zuckerberg%20said%20he%20opposed%20the%20proposal%2C%20according%20to%20a%20senior%20White%20House%20official%20directly%20familiar%20with%20the%20conversation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnother%20person%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter%20said%20Zuckerberg%20did%20not%20ask%20Trump%20to%20change%20his%20position%2C%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ebut%20told%20him%20that%20people%20the%20White%20House%20might%20appoint%20to%20the%20regulatory%20body%20should%20reflect%20Trump's%20own%20approach%20to%20AI%2C%20which%20is%20widely%20seen%20as%20light-touch.%20That%20person%20added%20that%20Trump%20called%20Zuckerberg%20first.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20exchange%20came%20after%20senior%20White%20House%20officials%20previewed%20the%20proposal%20for%20a%20FINRA-style%20industry%20regulator%20with%20Trump%20and%20separately%20with%20major%20tech%20companies%2C%20including%20Meta%2C%20OpenAI%2C%20and%20Anthropic%2C%20in%20mid-August%2C%20said%20the%20White%20House%20official.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFINRA%20is%20an%20industry-led%20body%20that%20serves%20as%20a%20front-line%20regulator%20in%20the%20U.S.%20securities%20markets%2C%20crafting%20and%20enforcing%20new%20rules%20for%20broker-dealer%20firms.%20It%20reports%20to%20the%20SEC%20and%20is%20led%20by%20a%20board%20made%20up%20of%2C%20among%20others%2C%20representatives%20from%20those%20FINRA%20member%20firms.%20The%20self-regulating%20organization%20oversees%20more%20than%203%2C000%20financial%20firms%2C%20which%20help%20fund%20the%20body.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20an%20AI%20industry%20watchdog%20may%20be%20tasked%20with%20vetting%20new%20models%2C%20FINRA%20has%20little%20involvement%20in%20signing%20off%20on%20new%20investment%20products.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20idea%20for%20an%20AI%20regulator%20was%20popularized%20by%20Hassabis%2C%20who%20suggested%20in%20a%20July%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fdemishassabis%2Farticle%2F2076957440109625718%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eessay%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20the%20US%20establish%20a%20new%20%26quot%3Bstandards%20body%26quot%3B%20modeled%20after%20FINRA%20to%20handle%20AI%20risks%20such%20as%20emerging%20cybersecurity%20threats.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHassabis%20briefed%20White%20House%20officials%20about%20the%20concept%20this%20summer%2C%20according%20to%20an%20administration%20official%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter.%20Google%20didn't%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Donald%20Trump%20sits%20at%20a%20conference%20table%20speaking%20with%20a%20suited%20official%20beside%20microphones%20and%20water%20bottles.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99bb573c906e69480d5e61%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPresident%20Donald%20Trump%20speaks%20with%20Demis%20Hassabis%20during%20a%20working%20lunch%20on%20innovation%20and%20AI%2C%20during%20the%20G7%20Summit%20on%20June%2017%2C%202026.%3Cp%3EAnna%20Moneymaker%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EA%20spokesperson%20for%20Meta%20declined%20to%20provide%20a%20statement.%20A%20White%20House%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement%2C%20%26quot%3BThe%20Trump%20Administration%20is%20committed%20to%20balancing%20innovation%20and%20security%20in%20AI%20policymaking.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20call%20between%20Zuckerberg%20and%20Trump%20underscores%20the%20competing%20pressures%20on%20senior%20White%20House%20officials%20as%20they%20craft%20AI%20policy%2C%20and%20the%20reality%20that%20any%20plans%20they%20craft%20remain%20vulnerable%20to%20private%20objections%20from%20industry%20delivered%20directly%20to%20Trump.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20debate%20comes%20at%20a%20fraught%20moment%20for%20the%20administration.%20AI%20agents%20are%20increasingly%20able%20to%20browse%20the%20web%2C%20operate%20software%2C%20and%20write%20code%20with%20limited%20human%20supervision%2C%20and%20have%20escaped%20human%20control%20in%20a%20string%20of%20high-profile%20incidents.%20Used%20by%20a%20hostile%20actor%2C%20they%20could%20also%20identify%20vulnerabilities%20or%20automate%20cyberattacks%20at%20a%20speed%20that%20outpaces%20existing%20safeguards.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EZuckerberg's%20involvement%20is%20not%20the%20first%20time%20the%20administration's%20AI%20policymaking%20process%20has%20faced%20last-minute%20drama.%20In%20May%2C%20David%20Sacks%2C%20the%20tech%20investor%20and%20White%20House%20advisor%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Fnews%2F2026%2F05%2F21%2Ftrump-ai-order-sacks-00933295%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eupended%20the%20process%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20issuing%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-ai-oversight-executive-order-draft-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esweeping%20executive%20order%20on%20AI%20%3C%2Fa%3Eby%20calling%20Trump%20the%20morning%20of%20the%20planned%20signing%20ceremony%20and%20convincing%20him%20to%20cancel%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETrump's%20one-on-one%20conversations%20with%20tech%20executives%20over%20the%20last%20several%20months%20have%20become%20an%20informal%20part%20of%20the%20policymaking%20process%20%E2%80%94%20capable%20of%20slowing%20or%20redirecting%20initiatives%20after%20they%20have%20been%20developed%20inside%20the%20administration%2C%20at%20times%20frustrating%20top%20White%20House%20officials.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20call%20with%20Zuckerberg%20did%20not%20quash%20the%20idea%20of%20a%20new%20industry%20regulator%20and%20it%20remains%20under%20consideration%20in%20the%20White%20House.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20an%20August%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Dff7770ee12ed325be24d8ce52e2f3475fbd32aa9eb00a2572b1da3e74052ed85%26postID%3D6a95e8c215943dd52563962c%26postSlug%3Dzuckerberg-told-trump-a-national-ai-regulator-is-a-flawed-idea-2026-9%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.meta.com%252Fthefutureisforeveryone%252F%253Fsrsltid%253DAfmBOorpY8OOntB4DIU9a9TUhDA1VhO0LOv6G0_j1fgo_Vgs4ttgT6Vr%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eessay%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Zuckerberg%20expressed%20skepticism%20about%20strict%20government%20oversight%20of%20new%20AI%20models%2C%20arguing%20that%20while%20the%20government%20and%20AI%20companies%20should%20collaborate%20closely%2C%20any%20policy%20which%20slows%20down%20a%20model's%20release%20%E2%80%94%20even%20by%20a%20month%20%E2%80%94%20would%20%26quot%3Badd%20significant%20risk%20to%20American%20leadership%26quot%3B%20over%20China.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20administration's%20broader%20effort%20to%20balance%20security%20and%20innovation%20in%20AI%20policymaking%20%E2%80%94%20while%20allowing%20industry%20to%20lead%20%E2%80%94%20remains%20a%20priority%2C%20according%20to%20the%20administration%20official.%20The%20person%20said%20officials%20are%20considering%20two%20paths%3A%20a%20FINRA-style%20regulator%2C%20or%20a%20voluntary%20industry%20group%20modeled%20on%20the%20Motion%20Picture%20Association%2C%20as%20Sacks%20has%20proposed%20for%20AI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESacks%20%E2%80%94%20Trump's%20former%20AI%20and%20crypto%20czar%20%E2%80%94%20is%20also%20opposed%20to%20the%20idea%20of%20a%20government%20regulator%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DSij_v-mcZXQ%26t%3D990s%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecalling%20it%20%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3Ba%20DMV%20for%20AI%26quot%3B%20where%20models%20%26quot%3Bget%20lined%20up%20in%20a%20queue%2C%20waiting%20to%20get%20their%20test%20done.%26quot%3B%20In%20May%2C%20Sacks%20delayed%20Trump's%20first%20AI%20executive%20order%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Fnews%2F2026%2F05%2F21%2Ftrump-ai-order-sacks-00933295%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ea%20single%20call%20to%20the%20president%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20POLITICO%20reported%20at%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%2C%20on%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DSij_v-mcZXQ%26t%3D990s%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAugust%2021%20episode%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20his%20%26quot%3BAll-In%26quot%3B%20podcast%2C%20Sacks%20outlined%20a%20system%20that%20he%20said%20has%20support%20from%20Elon%20Musk%3A%20creating%20an%20AI%20regulator%20like%20the%20Motion%20Pictures%20Association%2C%20which%20administers%20the%20voluntary%20MPA%20film%20rating%20system%20that%20gives%20movies%20%26quot%3BR%26quot%3B%20or%20%26quot%3BPG-13%26quot%3B%20labels.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhat%20the%20MPA%20did%20then%20was%20promote%20standards%20that%20then%20forestalled%20more%20intrusive%2C%20heavy-handed%20government%20action%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMusk%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mark%20Zuckerberg%20speaks%20with%20David%20Sacks%20at%20a%20formal%20dining%20table%20with%20glasses%20and%20floral%20centerpieces.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99bc5fb56943d508c4b365%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDavid%20Sacks%2C%20former%20Trump%20AI%20advisor%2C%20and%20Mark%20Zuckerberg%2C%20during%20a%20White%20House%20dinner%20with%20tech%20leaders%20on%20Sept.%204%2C%202025.%3Cp%3EGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFINRA%2C%20a%20private%20not-for-profit%20membership%20organization%20that%20operates%20under%20SEC%20supervision%2C%20writes%20and%20enforces%20rules%20for%20its%20over%203%2C000%20member%20brokerage%20firms%20and%20630%2C000%20registered%20representatives.%20Its%20operations%20are%20funded%20by%20member%20fees%2C%20while%20rule%20changes%20are%20subject%20to%20SEC%20review.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20AI%20version%20of%20FINRA%20funded%20by%20industry%20fees%20could%20attract%20the%20necessary%20technical%20talent%20to%20conduct%20testing%2C%20and%20it%20would%20create%20a%20common%20criteria%20for%20assessing%20models%2C%20but%20critics%20of%20the%20idea%20are%20concerned%20that%20voluntary%20standards%20and%20pre-release%20testing%20could%20eventually%20be%20codified%20into%20law.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20biggest%20AI%20companies%20haven't%20publicly%20endorsed%20or%20opposed%20the%20plan%20for%20a%20regulator%2C%20though%20Anthropic%20co-founder%20Jack%20Clark%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fdemishassabis%2Fstatus%2F2077436920557433267%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eposted%3C%2Fa%3E%20favorably%20about%20the%20idea%20on%20X%20in%20July.%20Anthropic%20declined%20to%20comment%20when%20asked%20about%20its%20stance%2C%20while%20OpenAI%20and%20Google%20didn't%20respond%20to%20requests%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EKatie%20Roof%2C%20Daniel%20Lippman%2C%20and%20Stephen%20Council%20contributed%20reporting.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3EThe%20Axel%20Springer%20Global%20Reporters%20Network%20is%20a%20multi-publication%20initiative%20publishing%20scoops%2C%20investigations%2C%20interviews%2C%20op-eds%2C%20and%20analysis%20that%20reverberate%20across%20the%20world.%20It%20connects%20journalists%20from%20Axel%20Springer%20brands%E2%80%94including%20POLITICO%2C%20The%20Telegraph%2C%20Business%20Insider%2C%20WELT%2C%20BILD%2C%20and%20Onet%E2%80%94%20on%20major%20stories%20for%20an%20international%20audience.%20Their%20ambitious%20reporting%20stretches%20across%20Axel%20Springer%20platforms%3A%20online%2C%20print%2C%20TV%2C%20and%20audio.%20Together%2C%20the%20outlets%20reach%20hundreds%20of%20millions%20of%20people%20worldwide.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fzuckerberg-told-trump-a-national-ai-regulator-is-a-flawed-idea-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788465112000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99a1e13c906e69480d5d5c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fzuckerberg-told-trump-a-national-ai-regulator-is-a-flawed-idea-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20previously%20unreported%20call%20marks%20the%20involvement%20of%20one%20of%20the%20world's%20top%20tech%20executives%20in%20a%20fraught%20White%20House%20policy%20debate.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Insider%20Inc.)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Volkswagen%20Says%20Cutting%20100%2C000%20Jobs%20By%20End%20Of%20Decade%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22German%20car%20giant%20Volkswagen%20said%20Thursday%20that%20management%20and%20unions%20had%20agreed%20to%20cut%20a%20further%2050%2C000%20jobs%20by%20the%20end%20of%20the%20decade%2C%20bringing%20total%20job%20losses%20to%20100%2C000.%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788464504000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fvolkswagen-says-cutting-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade-11999652%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22German%20car%20giant%20Volkswagen%20said%20Thursday%20that%20management%20and%20unions%20had%20agreed%20to%20cut%20a%20further%2050%2C000%20jobs%20by%20the%20end%20of%20the%20decade%2C%20bringing%20total%20job%20losses%20to%20100%2C000.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fvolkswagen-says-cutting-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade-11999652%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-ndtv-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fvolkswagen-says-cutting-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade-11999652%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fvolkswagen-says-cutting-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade-11999652%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Suno%20Kills%20Controversial%20Mary%20J.%20Blige%20Ad%20Where%20She%20Seems%20to%20Endorse%20the%20AI%20Music%20Generator%26nbsp%3B