kplace%20on%20several%20occasions.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Ffamily-blames-harassment-by-woman-for-guwahati-doctors-death-11999450%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-ndtv-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Ffamily-blames-harassment-by-woman-for-guwahati-doctors-death-11999450%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Ffamily-blames-harassment-by-woman-for-guwahati-doctors-death-11999450%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I'm%20a%20VC%20with%205%20kids.%20I%20encourage%20them%20to%20use%20AI%20and%20not%20to%20pick%20the%20safest%20career.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lori%20Cashman%20headshot%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a970c811f60b9f4b163384c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22557%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELori%20Cashman%20is%20raising%20five%20kids%2C%20including%20two%20sets%20of%20twins.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lori%20Cashman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ELori%20Cashman%20has%20two%20sets%20of%20twins%2C%20who%20are%2021%20and%2019%2C%20plus%20an%2018-year-old.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20pays%20for%20their%20AI%20subscriptions%20and%20talks%20about%20the%20nuances%20of%20AI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20wants%20them%20to%20hone%20their%20critical%20thinking%20in%20college%2C%20not%20prepare%20for%20a%20specific%20career.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%3C%2Fem%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fvisibleventures.com%2Fteam%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3ELori%20Cashman%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%2C%20managing%20partner%20at%20Visible%20Ventures.%20It%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20people%20hear%20I%20had%20five%20kids%20within%20three%20years%2C%20they%20assume%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-a-baby-can-see-every-month-for-the-first-year-of-its-life-2017-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebaby%20years%3C%2Fa%3E%20must%20have%20been%20the%20hardest.%20But%20when%20the%20kids%20were%20babies%20and%20toddlers%2C%20I%20managed%20pretty%20well.%20I%20could%20anticipate%20their%20needs%2C%20change%20up%20their%20routines%2C%20or%20hire%20a%20babysitter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThings%20got%20trickier%20as%20they%20got%20older.%20Today%20my%20twins%20are%2021%20and%2019%2C%20and%20my%20youngest%20son%20is%2018.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftwins-share-what-they-wish-people-stopped-saying-2023-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eolder%20twins%3C%2Fa%3E%20are%20entering%20their%20senior%20year%20of%20college%2C%20while%20the%20younger%20ones%20will%20start%20college%20in%20the%20fall%2C%20when%20my%20youngest%20will%20be%20a%20high%20school%20senior.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20also%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvc-founder-shares-traits-he-looks-for-from-founders-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Efounder%20of%20a%20venture%20capital%3C%2Fa%3E%20firm%20that%20works%20with%20many%20Gen%20Z%20founders.%20I%20think%20this%20generation%20is%20entering%20adulthood%20at%20a%20uniquely%20destabilizing%20moment%2C%20with%20AI%20reshaping%20the%20workforce.%20I%20have%20worries%2C%20but%20I'm%20also%20hopeful.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a717e84e-0bf3-45d3-979a-9e09b6c627f9%5C%22%3EAI%20is%20going%20to%20create%20lots%20of%20opportunities%20for%20this%20generation%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThings%20are%20changing%20so%20quickly%20with%20AI.%20It's%20really%20within%20the%20last%20year%20that%20I've%20been%20beating%20the%20drum%2C%20encouraging%20my%20kids%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fteaching-kids-use-ai-chatgpt-responsibly-learn-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Euse%20any%20AI%20%3C%2Fa%3Etools%20they%20can.%20They%20have%20an%20opportunity%20to%20get%20in%20at%20the%20ground%20level%20of%20something%20that's%20going%20to%20be%20very%20big.%20I%20want%20them%20to%20embrace%20that%3A%20roll%20up%20their%20sleeves%20and%20learn%20as%20much%20as%20they%20can.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222733%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lori%20Cashman%20family%20photo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a998a67b56943d508c4b145%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221190%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELori%20Cashman%20is%20a%20mom%20of%20five%2C%20including%20two%20sets%20of%20twins.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lori%20Cashman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20speak%20with%20investors%2C%20I%20tell%20them%2C%20%26quot%3BThe%20surfer%20picks%20the%20wave.%26quot%3B%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmost-important-inventions-of-last-30-years-internet-iphone-netflix-facebook-google-2019-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETechnological%20innovations%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20whether%20it%20was%20the%20early%20internet%20or%20the%20shift%20to%20mobile%2C%20have%20always%20created%20waves%20of%20opportunity%2C%20and%20AI%20will%20too%2C%20for%20those%20who%20choose%20to%20ride.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20pay%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdad-chatgpt-tutor-helps-my-kids-get-better-grades-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAI%20subscriptions%20for%20our%20kids%3C%2Fa%3E.%20We%20also%20make%20room%20for%20nuanced%20conversations.%20There%20are%20a%20lot%20of%20mixed%20messages%20about%20AI%2C%20especially%20on%20campus.%20What%20academic%20dishonesty%20entails%20varies%20from%20professor%20to%20professor.%20I%20want%20my%20kids%20to%20use%20AI%2C%20but%20not%20abuse%20it%2C%20and%20no%20one%20has%20clear-cut%20answers%20for%20what%20that%20looks%20like%2C%20yet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224d270a52-e745-4e0a-892c-685d07367af0%5C%22%3EInterdisciplinary%20work%20is%20more%20important%20than%20ever%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20my%20younger%20three%20kids%20prepare%20to%20start%20college%2C%20I'm%20encouraging%20them%20to%20focus%20on%20interdisciplinary%20learning.%20Most%20of%20my%20kids%20are%20studying%20economics%20in%20some%20form.%20I%20would%20like%20them%20to%20take%20advantage%20of%20different%20concentrations%20and%20certificates%20to%20enhance%20that%20degree.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20important%20they%20expand%20their%20thinking%20outside%20their%20major.%20College%20isn't%20about%20preparing%20for%20a%20specific%20job%20anymore.%20It's%20about%20learning%20to%20apply%20your%20skills%20at%20the%20intersection%20of%20different%20sectors.%20Maybe%20that's%20medicine%20and%20climate%3B%20humanities%20and%20technology%3B%20sports%20and%20marketing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20ability%20to%20solve%20interdisciplinary%20problems%20will%20serve%20Gen%20Z%20well%20in%20the%20future.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22dbf6df78-2684-4e42-97d7-ea0825862420%5C%22%3EI%20want%20my%20kids%20to%20have%20a%20playful%20approach%20to%20building%20skills%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EYoung%20kids%20learn%20through%20play%2C%20and%20young%20adults%20can%20do%20the%20same.%20Not%20everything%20should%20be%20about%20r%C3%A9sum%C3%A9%20building.%20As%20serious%20as%20some%20of%20these%20discussions%20are%2C%20young%20people%20ought%20to%20be%20somewhat%20playful%20in%20their%20approach.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThings%20are%20changing%2C%20yes.%20But%20being%20able%20to%20follow%20your%20curiosities%20and%20interests%20is%20a%20great%20way%20to%20build%20real-world%20experience%20and%20exposure.%20That%2C%20in%20turn%2C%20will%20equip%20them%20for%20whatever%20job%20they%20land%20in.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20believe%20Gen%20Z%20will%20be%20very%20entrepreneurial%20and%20end%20up%20trailblazing%20paths%20that%20look%20different%20from%20past%20careers.%20The%20promise%20of%20AI%20is%20that%20more%20people%20than%20ever%20will%20have%20the%20tools%20they%20need%20to%20build%20a%20successful%20business%2C%20as%20long%20as%20they%20can%20conceptualize%20new%20ideas.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e022d29f-45e5-491b-82da-f89790ecdc81%5C%22%3EMy%20kids%20are%20all%20so%20different%2C%20despite%20being%20close%20in%20age%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBeing%20a%20twin%20mom%2C%20times%20two%2C%20is%20interesting.%20My%20kids%20are%20from%20the%20same%20bloodline%2C%20raised%20at%20virtually%20the%20same%20time%2C%20and%20they're%20all%20so%20different.%20Having%20them%20so%20close%20together%20was%20challenging%2C%20especially%20in%20the%20teen%20years.%20Unlike%20parents%20with%20bigger%20age%20gaps%20between%20children%2C%20I%20didn't%20have%20time%20to%20recognize%20my%20mistakes%20and%20adjust%20my%20parenting%20style.%20Like%20any%20parent%2C%20I%20was%20just%20doing%20the%20best%20I%20could.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20how%20I%20think%20about%20supporting%20Gen%20Z.%20There's%20never%20been%20a%20pace%20of%20change%20like%20this.%20Helping%20young%20adults%20any%20way%20we%20can%20%E2%80%94%20whether%20that's%20mentorship%2C%20a%20coffee%20chat%2C%20or%20internships%20%E2%80%94%20is%20the%20best%20we%20can%20do%20to%20prepare%20them%20for%20an%20uncertain%20future.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flori-cashman-visible-ventures-gen-z-kids-ai-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788460681000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a970e438dc004cd687c7b1f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flori-cashman-visible-ventures-gen-z-kids-ai-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Lori%20Cashman%20has%20five%20Gen%20Z%20kids.%20She%20pays%20for%20their%20AI%20subscriptions%20and%20encourages%20them%20to%20embrace%20the%20technology%20as%20they%20enter%20the%20workforce.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Kelly%20Burch)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%20GoFundMe%20raises%20more%20than%20%24650%2C000%20for%20newborn%20daughter%20of%20BofA%20employee%20Erin%20Piacenti%20killed%20in%20Times%20Square%20stabbing%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222392%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22GoFundMe%20page%20for%20%26quot%3BIn%20Memory%20of%20Erin%20Piacenti%3A%20Supporting%20Madison's%20Future.%26quot%3B%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a99b5f33c906e69480d5e22%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221298%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20GoFundMe%20to%20support%20Erin%20Piacenti's%20daughter%20has%20raised%20more%20than%20%24600%2C000.%3Cp%3EGoFundMe%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EErin%20Piacenti%2C%20a%2032-year-old%20vice%20president%20at%20Bank%20of%20America%2C%20was%20killed%20on%20Monday%20in%20a%20stabbing.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20had%20just%20returned%20from%20maternity%20leave%2C%20and%20a%20GoFundMe%20for%20her%20daughter%20has%20raised%20more%20than%20%24650%2C000.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EPiacenti%20was%20also%20a%20singer%20and%20recently%20celebrated%20her%20second%20wedding%20anniversary.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbank-of-america-employee-times-square-stabbing-erin-piacenti-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EErin%20Piacenti%3C%2Fa%3E%20had%20finished%20her%20first%20day%20back%20from%20maternity%20leave%20at%20Bank%20of%20America%20on%20Monday%20afternoon%2C%20when%20she%20was%20fatally%20stabbed%20in%20Times%20Square.%20A%20few%20days%20after%20her%20death%2C%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gofundme.com%2Ff%2Fin-memory-of-erin-piacenti-supporting-madisons-future%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGoFundMe%20page%20%3C%2Fa%3Eto%20support%20her%20five-month-old%2C%20Madison%2C%20has%20raised%20more%20than%20%24650%2C000.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPiacenti%2C%20who%20was%2032%20when%20she%20died%2C%20was%20a%20vice%20president%20at%20the%20firm's%20Business%20Selection%20and%20Conflicts%20group%2C%20the%20team%20responsible%20for%20analyzing%20new%20potential%20business%20mandates%20in%20the%20investment%20bank.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EShe'd%20been%20at%20the%20bank%20for%20around%2018%20months%20before%20Monday%20afternoon%2C%20when%20Pamela%20Cisneros%2C%2049%2C%20fatally%20stabbed%20her%20in%20the%20abdomen%20in%20what%20New%20York%20City%20police%20described%20as%20an%20unprovoked%20attack.%20Cisneros%20also%20injured%20another%20victim%20before%20officers%20shot%20and%20killed%20her%20at%20the%20scene.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20are%20shocked%20and%20deeply%20saddened%20by%20the%20tragic%20loss%20of%20our%20colleague%2C%26quot%3B%20a%20Bank%20of%20America%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%20%26quot%3BShe%20was%20a%20valued%20teammate%20who%20will%20be%20greatly%20missed.%20Our%20hearts%20go%20out%20to%20her%20family%20and%20all%20of%20her%20loved%20ones.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPiacenti's%20career%20gives%20a%20glimpse%20into%20her%20life%2C%20the%20GoFundMe%20page%20says%2C%20adding%20that%20she%20was%20%26quot%3Ba%20thoughtful%20daughter%20and%20sister%2C%20a%20loyal%20friend%2C%20a%20devoted%20partner%20and%20companion%20in%20every%20aspect%20of%20Frank's%20life%2C%20and%2C%20most%20recently%2C%20an%20incredibly%20loving%20mother%20to%20Madison.%26quot%3B%20In%20photos%20on%20the%20fundraising%20page%2C%20Piacenti%20wraps%20Madison%20in%20a%20towel%20on%20a%20rocky%20beach%20and%2C%20grinning%2C%20holds%20her%20in%20a%20white%20dress%20at%20what%20appears%20to%20be%20her%20baptism.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe'd%20recently%20celebrated%20her%20second%20wedding%20anniversary%20with%20Frank%20Piacenti%2C%20whom%20she%20met%20at%20Fordham%20Law%20School.%20They%20worked%20together%20for%20at%20least%20two%20years%20on%20the%20Fordham%20Law%20Review%2C%20according%20to%20past%20editions.%20A%20representative%20for%20the%20university%20said%20the%20school%20is%20%26quot%3Bheartbroken%20to%20learn%20of%20the%20tragic%20and%20senseless%20loss%20of%20our%20alumna.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20family%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement%20that%20they%20are%20%26quot%3Bdevastated%20by%20the%20loss%20of%20Erin%20and%20request%20privacy%20at%20this%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20asked%20that%20people%20donate%20to%20the%20GoFundMe%20in%20lieu%20of%20other%20gifts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20joining%20Bank%20of%20America%2C%20Piacenti%20worked%20at%20the%20law%20firm%20Davis%20Polk%20for%20more%20than%20three%20years%2C%20focusing%20on%20mergers%20and%20acquisitions%20for%20part%20of%20that%20time%2C%20according%20to%20an%20email%20sent%20out%20to%20the%20law%20firm's%20employees%20after%20she%20was%20identified.%20A%20Davis%20Polk%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement%20that%20she%20will%20be%20%26quot%3Bgreatly%20missed.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20she%20was%20an%20undergraduate%20at%20the%20University%20of%20Pennsylvania%2C%20Piacenti%20was%20a%20member%20of%20the%20Alpha%20Phi%20sorority%20and%20sang%20in%20an%20a%20capella%20group%2C%20belting%20pop%20songs%20in%20YouTube%20videos.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPiacenti's%20death%20comes%20just%20over%20a%20year%20after%20a%20gunman%20killed%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fblackstone-real-estate-executive-wesley-lepatner-killed-gunman-345-park-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWesley%20LePatner%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20an%20executive%20in%20Blackstone's%20real%20estate%20business%2C%20at%20her%20office.%20Though%20different%20in%20circumstance%2C%20both%20events%20shook%20Wall%20Street's%20sense%20of%20safety%20and%20sparked%20an%20outpouring%20of%20support.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20of%20Thursday%20afternoon%2C%20donations%20continued%20to%20pour%20into%20the%20GoFundMe%20from%20more%20than%206%2C700%20contributors.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2F