l%20be%20replaced%20by%20a%20company%20advisor%20on%20an%20interim%20basis.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EYouTube%20sports%20collective%20Dude%20Perfect%20is%20losing%20its%20first%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fyoutubers-dude-perfect-hired-ceo-andrew-yaffe-explains-his-strategy-2024-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECEO%2C%20Andrew%20Yaffe%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20after%20about%20two%20years%20in%20the%20role%2C%20a%20company%20rep%20confirmed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPatrick%20Hurley%2C%20a%20principal%20at%20BP%20Capital%20Fund%20Advisors%20and%20an%20advisor%20to%20Dude%20Perfect%2C%20will%20serve%20as%20interim%20CEO.%20The%20company%20has%20hired%20a%20firm%20to%20begin%20the%20search%20for%20a%20permanent%20chief%20executive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20joint%20statement%20from%20the%20company's%20board%20and%20Yaffe%20said%20the%20change%20was%20a%20mutual%20decision.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAfter%20two%20years%20of%20strong%20growth%2C%20Andrew%20and%20the%20Board%20have%20decided%20that%20now%20is%20the%20right%20time%20for%20new%20leadership%20at%20Dude%20Perfect.%20As%20the%20social%20media%20landscape%20continues%20to%20evolve%2C%20they%20developed%20different%20perspectives%20on%20the%20company's%20next%20phase%20and%20the%20best%20path%20forward%2C%26quot%3B%20it%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20statement%20said%20that%20the%20company%20had%20grown%20revenue%20significantly%20since%20Yaffe%20joined%2C%20driven%20by%20partnerships%20with%20State%20Farm%2C%20Disney%2C%20and%20others%2C%20and%20expanded%20through%20its%20live%20tour%20and%20other%20initiatives.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20joint%20statement%20came%20via%20prominent%20publicist%20Matthew%20Hiltzik%2C%20who's%20represented%20a%20wide%20range%20of%20public%20figures%20and%20is%20known%20for%20handling%20crisis%20PR%20situations%2C%20though%20his%20work%20goes%20beyond%20that.%20In%20addition%20to%20working%20with%20Dude%20Perfect%20over%20the%20years%2C%20he%20represents%20fellow%20creator%20MrBeast.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYaffe%2C%20a%20former%20NBA%20exec%2C%20said%20in%20a%20LinkedIn%20post%20that%20he%20and%20Dude%20Perfect%20%26quot%3Bdecided%20to%20go%20our%20separate%20ways.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI'm%20so%20proud%20of%20what%20we%20built%20together%20and%20how%20much%20progress%20we%20were%20able%20to%20make%20in%20less%20than%2024%20months%2C%20adding%20world-class%20talent%20to%20our%20team%2C%20defining%20a%20mission%20to%20Inspire%20Play%20and%20having%20clear%20business%20results%20and%20momentum%20to%20show%20for%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAxios%20first%20reported%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2F2026%2F09%2F03%2Fdude-perfect-ceo-out%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Enews%20of%20Yaffe's%20departure%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETexas-based%20Dude%20Perfect%2C%20founded%20in%202009%20by%20five%20college%20roommates%2C%20is%20one%20of%20the%20few%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcreator-platforms-make-more-money-old-media-wpp-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecreator-led%20companies%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20receive%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmrbeast-bitmine-immersion-investment-youtube-jimmy-donaldson-crypto-tom-lee-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esignificant%20outside%20funding%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20raising%20over%20%24100%20million%20in%20early%202024%20from%20Highmount%20Capital.%20The%20five%20Dudes%20%E2%80%94%20Garrett%20Hilbert%2C%20Tyler%20Toney%2C%20Cody%20Jones%2C%20Coby%20Cotton%2C%20and%20Cory%20Cotton%20%E2%80%94%20are%20known%20for%20their%20wholesome%2C%20kid-friendly%20content%20featuring%20sports%20tricks.%20Based%20in%20Frisco%2C%20Texas%2C%20the%20company%20has%20grown%20into%20a%20sprawling%20enterprise%20with%20more%20than%2062%20million%20YouTube%20subscribers%2C%20merch%20sales%2C%20and%20a%2022-city%20live%20tour.%20It's%20also%20announced%20plans%20to%20open%20a%20theme%20park%2C%20but%20hasn't%2