f%2C%20I%20ventured%20out%20and%20was%20a%20manager%20at%20a%20store%20for%20a%20minute%2C%20but%20unfortunately%2C%20that%20shop%20closed.%20So%20I%20thought%2C%20%26quot%3BOkay%2C%20maybe%20it's%20time%2C%20give%20Uber%20another%20shot.%20I'll%20go%20back.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithin%20weeks%2C%20I%20was%20rehired%20and%20working%20on%20a%20team%20of%2012%20to%2015%20people.%20I%20was%20constantly%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdad-tech-works-in-office-3-days-week-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworking%20in%20the%20office%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20too.%20I%20was%20also%20on%20an%20employee%20experience%20team.%20I%20was%20planning%20events%20for%20upcoming%20holidays%2C%20everything%20like%20that.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20shocked%20when%20I%20received%20an%20email%20from%20my%20manager%20saying%20that%20they%20and%20other%20people%20on%20my%20team%20were%20also%20let%20go.%20To%20me%2C%20nothing%20alluded%20to%20this.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20I%20heard%2C%20the%20company%20had%20just%20laid%20off%20a%20couple%20of%20people%2C%20maybe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fuber-layoffs-ai-prompts-cuts-to-customer-service-jobs-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20month%20or%20so%3C%2Fa%3E%20ago%2C%20and%20it%20seemed%20like%20we%20had%20a%20minute%20to%20not%20worry%20before%20they%20were%20going%20to%20do%20more.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227ca404c9-1235-46c8-9567-de157e4c0eb3%5C%22%3EMy%20access%20got%20cut%20off%20pretty%20quickly%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20internal%20system%20access%20was%20cut%20off%20at%205%20p.m.%20local%20time%20yesterday%2C%20but%20I%20wasn't%20able%20to%20get%20into%20Slack%20before%20then.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%2021%20weeks%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-to-consider-before-you-sign-severance-contract-labor-lawyer-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eseverance%20pay%3C%2Fa%3E%20based%20on%20tenure%20and%20two%20months%20of%20%26