ts%20enrolled%20exclusively%20online%20from%20each%20institution's%20total%20enrollment%20number.%20We%20then%20ranked%20schools%20using%20that%20adjusted%20figure.%20Students%20taking%20a%20mix%20of%20online%20and%20in-person%20classes%20remained%20in%20the%20count.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20means%20online-only%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcollege-student-online-classes-traveling-world-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eonline-heavy%20institutions%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20such%20as%20the%20University%20of%20Maryland%20Global%20Campus%2C%20did%20not%20necessarily%20rank%20first%2C%20despite%20having%20overall%20larger%20student%20populations%20than%20other%20institutions%20in%20their%20states.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20of%20the%20colleges%20in%20this%20ranking%20encompass%20more%20than%20one%20physical%20campus.%20Depending%20on%20the%20institution%2C%20the%20data%20may%20cover%20one%20campus%20or%20several%20campuses%20and%20locations%20reported%20together.%20Where%20IPEDS%20specifies%20a%20campus%2C%20that%20name%20is%20included%20in%20the%20slide%20description.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20the%20data%20is%20provisional%2C%20they're%20not%20necessarily%20an%20exact%20final%20count%20of%20how%20many%20students%20attended%20that%20fall.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20the%20largest%20colleges%20by%20enrollment%20in%20every%20state%2C%20excluding%20exclusively%20online%20students.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EALABAMA%3A%20The%20University%20of%20Alabama%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222605%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Aerial%20view%20of%20Coleman%20Coliseum%20entrance%20with%20Alabama%20logo%2C%20flags%2C%20plaza%2C%20and%20parked%20vehicles.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9160b879f11f0a89f91efe%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221954%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EColeman%20Coliseum%3Cp%3ECRobertson%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEnrollment%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E40%2